{"id":"6ad514459f1a0090","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-binary-integer-programming.md","title":"0/1整数规划可满足性","display":"df-binary-integer-programming — 0/1整数规划可满足性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-binary-integer-programming","aliases":["28-df-binary-integer-programming"],"display":"df-binary-integer-programming — 0/1整数规划可满足性","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Example 2.3 and Theorem 2.16","source_printed_pages":"40,52","source_pdf_pages":"66,78","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-binary-integer-programming"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-binary-integer-programming</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-binary-integer-programming — 0/1整数规划可满足性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Example 2.3 and Theorem 2.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"40,52"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"66,78"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb Q^m\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb Q^m\\)</span>；向量不等式逐坐标解释。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BIP}}:\\{(m,n,A,b):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n},\\ b\\in\\mathbb Q^m\\}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BIP}}:\\{(m,n,A,b):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n},\\ b\\in\\mathbb Q^m\\}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是固定单射编码：有理数采用约分后的带符号二进制分子和正分母，矩阵按行列顺序列出全部项，维度和字段使用自分隔列表。编码像可在多项式时间内识别，编码与像上的逆在各自输入表示长度的多项式时间可计算，码长与维度和全部显式系数表的二进制长度彼此多项式有界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BIP}}(m,n,A,b):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n},\\ b\\in\\mathbb Q^m,\\ \\exists u\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;Au\\ge b\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BIP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BIP}}(m,n,A,b):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n},\\ b\\in\\mathbb Q^m,\\ \\exists u\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;Au\\ge b\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项仅允许每个未知量取0或1，系数可以为任意有理数。m=0时约束真，n=0时检验0≥b，故边界也确定。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Example 2.3 and Theorem 2.16；印刷 pp.40,52 / PDF pp.66,78。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb Q^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BIP}}:\\{(m,n,A,b):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n},\\ b\\in\\mathbb Q^m\\}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BIP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BIP}}(m,n,A,b):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\mathbb Q^{m\\times n},\\ b\\in\\mathbb Q^m,\\ \\exists u\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;Au\\ge b\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1809,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tmsat]]、[[28-thm-tmsat-np-complete]]、[[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]、[[28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-np-certificate-search]]。"},{"id":"e4b2b1248dfeccfd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BIP}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]；$\\mathrm{NPComplete}$ 见 [[28-df-np-complete]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}